{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "改则生不改则死  (Reform and Live, Stagnate and Die)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao silences the boardroom by challenging the industry's addiction to imported formats, then rallies Kaiwen and Bu Xiaogu outside with a four-character battle cry. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有我们的制作，你觉得中国会有多少观众知道美国还有个十二歌王？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有星天，你们的商业价值、你们的艺人价值都在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "您能回答我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在的状况是过度依赖海外版权，国内跟风很猖獗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一线平台都在同质化竞争，确实是赚了一些钱，但是吃相太难看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我只知道如果不改变就没有出路：改则生，不改则死！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改则生，不改则死，这句话说得好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可咱们这么一改，各方老板的心里可就翻江倒海了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们这么强推改版，他们能同意吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他们当然不会同意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四个字：强推到底！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有我们的制作，你觉得中国会有多少观众知道美国还有个十二歌王？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without our production work, how many viewers in China would even know America's Twelve Singers?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有星天，你们的商业价值、你们的艺人价值都在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without Xingtian, where would your commercial value and the value of your artists be?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "您能回答我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can you answer me that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在的状况是过度依赖海外版权，国内跟风很猖獗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today's problem is over-reliance on overseas formats while copycat shows run wild at home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一线平台都在同质化竞争，确实是赚了一些钱，但是吃相太难看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Top platforms are locked in copycat competition—sure, they made money, yet it looks ugly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我只知道如果不改变就没有出路：改则生，不改则死！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All I know is there is no way forward without change: reform and live, fail to reform and die!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改则生，不改则死，这句话说得好！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Reform and live, fail to reform and die—well said!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可咱们这么一改，各方老板的心里可就翻江倒海了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, a shake-up like this has every boss's stomach churning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们这么强推改版，他们能同意吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we push the revamp this hard, will they ever agree?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他们当然不会同意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course they will not agree.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what do we do?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四个字：强推到底！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Four words: push it through to the end!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有我们的制作，你觉得中国会有多少观众知道美国还有个十二歌王？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果没有星天，你们的商业价值、你们的艺人价值都在哪儿？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "您能回答我吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在的状况是过度依赖海外版权，国内跟风很猖獗。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "一线平台都在同质化竞争，确实是赚了一些钱，但是吃相太难看。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我只知道如果不改变就没有出路：改则生，不改则死！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改则生，不改则死，这句话说得好！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可咱们这么一改，各方老板的心里可就翻江倒海了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们这么强推改版，他们能同意吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他们当然不会同意。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "四个字：强推到底！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backed by Chun Yuqiao's fearless resolve, Bu Xiaogu's first major format design becomes Unit One's banner cause. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
